---
// src/pages/refund-policy.astro
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

import { LEGAL } from "@/data/legal";
---

<LegalLayout title="Refund & Returns Policy">
  <div class="mb-10 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-100 p-6">
    <p class="!mb-2 font-architects-daughter text-xl tracking-wider text-[#6b5252]">
      the short version
    </p>
    <ul class="!mb-0">
      <li>Original artworks and prints can be returned within {LEGAL.returnWindowDays} days of delivery, if they are unused and in their original condition.</li>
      <li>Damaged or wrong item? Tell us within {LEGAL.damageReportHours} hours of delivery, with photos, and we will make it right.</li>
      <li>Commissions are custom-made, so they follow their own rules (see below).</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>
    Every piece from {LEGAL.brand} is made by hand and packed with care, and we
    want you to be happy with what arrives. This policy explains how returns,
    refunds and cancellations work. It forms part of our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Cancelling an order</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel an order for a full refund any time before it has shipped.
    Email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> with your order
    number as soon as possible. Once an order has shipped, the return process
    below applies instead.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Original artworks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      You may request a return within <strong>{LEGAL.returnWindowDays} days of
      delivery</strong>, provided the artwork is in the same condition you
      received it and in its original packaging.
    </li>
    <li>
      Return shipping is paid by you, unless the piece arrived damaged or not
      as described. We recommend a tracked and insured service, as you are
      responsible for the item until it reaches us.
    </li>
    <li>
      Original shipping charges are not refunded unless the return is due to
      our error or damage in transit.
    </li>
    <li>Originals are one-of-a-kind, so we cannot offer exchanges.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Prints</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Prints can be returned within <strong>{LEGAL.returnWindowDays} days of
      delivery</strong> if they are unmarked, uncreased and in their original
      packaging. Return shipping is paid by you.
    </li>
    <li>
      If a print arrives damaged, misprinted or is not the item you ordered, we
      will send a replacement or refund you in full, including shipping.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Commissions</h2>
  <p>
    Commissions are made to your brief, so they cannot be resold or reused and
    are not eligible for change-of-mind returns.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Before work begins:</strong> if you cancel before any work has
      started, your deposit is refunded in full.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>After work has begun:</strong> the {LEGAL.commissionDepositPercent}%
      deposit covers time and materials already committed and is non-refundable.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>After the sketch is approved:</strong> payments made are not
      refundable, except where we are unable to deliver the work.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Finished piece:</strong> if it arrives damaged, or differs
      significantly from the brief we agreed in writing, contact us and we will
      repair, redo or refund as appropriate.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Damaged, lost or incorrect items</h2>
  <p>
    If your order arrives damaged or is not what you ordered, please email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> within <strong>{LEGAL.damageReportHours} hours of delivery</strong> with:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>your order number;</li>
    <li>clear photos of the item, the damage and all the packaging;</li>
    <li>a short description of what happened.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Please keep the packaging, as we may need it to make a claim with the
    carrier. We will offer a replacement, a repair or a full refund, including
    the original shipping cost. If a parcel is lost in transit, we will work with
    the carrier and either resend the item or refund you.
  </p>

  <h2>6. How to request a return</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> within the
      return window with your order number and the reason for the return.
    </li>
    <li>We will reply with return instructions and the address to send the item to. Please do not send anything back before you hear from us.</li>
    <li>Pack the artwork securely (poor packing is the most common cause of damage on the way back).</li>
    <li>When the item reaches us, we will inspect it and confirm your refund.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Approved refunds are sent to your original payment method within
      <strong>{LEGAL.refundProcessingDays} business days</strong> of us
      receiving and inspecting the return (or approving your claim).
    </li>
    <li>
      Your bank or card provider may need additional time to show the refund.
      We refund the amount that was charged to you; exchange-rate differences or
      fees applied by your bank are outside our control.
    </li>
    <li>
      If a returned item arrives damaged or in a different condition from how
      it was sent, we may refuse the return or reduce the refund to reflect
      the loss in value.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>8. Items we cannot accept back</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Custom commissions (except as described above).</li>
    <li>Items damaged after delivery through misuse, framing, mounting or alteration.</li>
    <li>Items returned after the return window, or without contacting us first.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>9. Customs, duties and taxes</h2>
  <p>
    Import duties and taxes are the buyer's responsibility and are not
    refundable, as they are collected by customs authorities and not by us. If
    you refuse a parcel or fail to collect it from customs, the return shipping
    and any fees charged to us may be deducted from your refund.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Your legal rights</h2>
  <p>
    This policy does not affect your statutory rights as a consumer, including
    the mandatory consumer rights of the country where you live.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about an order or this policy? Email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>